<%- include('partials/header', {
    title: typeof title !== 'undefined' ? title : 'Privacy Policy | Qualitick Collections',
    page: 'privacy',
    description: 'Privacy Policy for Qualitick Collections - Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.',
    keywords: 'privacy policy, data protection, personal information, cookies, qualitick collections',
    canonicalUrl: typeof canonicalUrl !== 'undefined' ? canonicalUrl : 'https://qualitick-collections.com/privacy',
    url: typeof url !== 'undefined' ? url : '/privacy',
    ogType: 'website'
}) %>

<!-- Privacy hero — same structure as Contact -->
<section class="contact-hero">
    <div class="contact-hero-inner">
        <span class="contact-eyebrow">Trust · Transparency</span>
        <h1 class="contact-hero-title">Privacy<br><em>Policy</em></h1>
        <p class="contact-hero-sub">
            Last updated <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) %>.
            We are committed to protecting your privacy and explaining clearly how we handle your information when you shop or browse with us.
        </p>
    </div>
    <img src="/images/icons/watermark.svg" alt="" class="contact-watermark" aria-hidden="true">
</section>

<div class="contact-container privacy-policy-page">
    <div class="privacy-policy-content">
                
                <!-- Information We Collect -->
                <div class="terms-category">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="fas fa-database"></i> Information We Collect
                    </h2>
                    <p>We collect information that you provide directly to us when you:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span><strong>Place an Order:</strong> We collect your name, email address, phone number, shipping address, and payment information to process and fulfill your orders.</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span><strong>Contact Us:</strong> When you submit a contact form, we collect your name, email address, phone number (optional), subject, and message to respond to your inquiries.</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span><strong>Subscribe to Newsletter:</strong> We collect your email address to send you updates about new products, special offers, and promotions.</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span><strong>Browse Our Website:</strong> We automatically collect certain information about your device, including your IP address, browser type, operating system, and pages you visit.</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- How We Use Your Information -->
                <div class="terms-category">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="fas fa-cogs"></i> How We Use Your Information
                    </h2>
                    <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span>Process and fulfill your orders, including payment processing and shipping</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span>Communicate with you about your orders, inquiries, and customer service requests</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span>Send you marketing communications (with your consent) about new products, promotions, and special offers</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span>Improve our website, products, and services based on your feedback and usage patterns</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span>Detect and prevent fraud, abuse, and security threats</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span>Comply with legal obligations and enforce our Terms & Conditions</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Payment Information -->
                <div class="terms-category">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="fas fa-credit-card"></i> Payment Information
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        We use third-party payment processors (Lenco Payment Gateway) to securely process your payments. When you make a purchase, your payment information is processed directly by our payment provider. We do not store your full credit card details or bank account information on our servers.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>Payment Methods:</strong> We accept Mobile Money (Airtel Money, MTN Money), Bank Transfer, and other secure payment methods. Your payment information is encrypted and transmitted securely to our payment processor.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Data Storage and Security -->
                <div class="terms-category">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Data Storage and Security
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        We implement appropriate technical and organizational security measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no method of transmission over the Internet or electronic storage is 100% secure.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Your personal information is stored securely in our database and is only accessible to authorized personnel who need it to perform their job duties. We retain your information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy, unless a longer retention period is required by law.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Third-Party Services -->
                <div class="terms-category">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="fas fa-handshake"></i> Third-Party Services
                    </h2>
                    <p>We may share your information with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating our website and conducting our business:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span><strong>Payment Processors:</strong> Lenco Payment Gateway processes your payments securely</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span><strong>Shipping Providers:</strong> We share your shipping address with courier services to deliver your orders</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span><strong>Email Services:</strong> We use email service providers to send you order confirmations and marketing communications</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span><strong>Analytics:</strong> We may use analytics services to understand how visitors use our website</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>
                        These third-party service providers are contractually obligated to protect your information and use it only for the purposes we specify.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Cookies and Tracking -->
                <div class="terms-category cookie-policy-section" id="cookies">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="fas fa-cookie"></i> Cookies and Tracking Technologies
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your browsing experience, analyze website traffic, and personalize content. Cookies are small text files stored on your device that help us remember your preferences and improve site functionality.
                    </p>

                    <!-- Cookie Overview Summary -->
                    <div class="cookie-overview">
                        <div class="cookie-overview-item">
                            <div class="cookie-overview-icon essential">
                                <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cookie-overview-content">
                                <h4>Essential</h4>
                                <p>3 cookies</p>
                                <span class="cookie-status always-active">Always Active</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="cookie-overview-item">
                            <div class="cookie-overview-icon analytics">
                                <i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cookie-overview-content">
                                <h4>Analytics</h4>
                                <p>3 cookies</p>
                                <span class="cookie-status requires-consent">Requires Consent</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="cookie-overview-item">
                            <div class="cookie-overview-icon preferences">
                                <i class="fas fa-cog"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="cookie-overview-content">
                                <h4>Preferences</h4>
                                <p>1 cookie</p>
                                <span class="cookie-status requires-consent">Requires Consent</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <h3 class="cookie-section-title">Types of Cookies We Use</h3>

                    <!-- Essential Cookies -->
                    <div class="cookie-info-section cookie-essential">
                        <div class="cookie-category-header">
                            <h4>
                                <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Essential Cookies
                            </h4>
                            <span class="cookie-badge essential-badge">Always Active</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            These cookies are strictly necessary for the website to function properly. They cannot be disabled and are always active.
                        </p>
                        <table class="cookie-table">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Cookie Name</th>
                                    <th>Purpose</th>
                                    <th>Expiration</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><code>cookie_consent</code></td>
                                    <td>Stores your cookie consent preferences</td>
                                    <td>1 year</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><code>session_id</code></td>
                                    <td>Maintains your session for security and functionality</td>
                                    <td>Session (deleted when browser closes)</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><code>csrf_token</code></td>
                                    <td>Protects against cross-site request forgery attacks</td>
                                    <td>Session (deleted when browser closes)</td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Analytics Cookies -->
                    <div class="cookie-info-section cookie-analytics">
                        <div class="cookie-category-header">
                            <h4>
                                <i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i> Analytics Cookies
                            </h4>
                            <span class="cookie-badge consent-badge">Requires Consent</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            These cookies help us understand how visitors interact with our website by collecting anonymous information. They are only set if you consent to Analytics cookies.
                        </p>
                        <table class="cookie-table">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Cookie Name</th>
                                    <th>Purpose</th>
                                    <th>Expiration</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><code>_ga</code></td>
                                    <td>Google Analytics: Distinguishes unique users</td>
                                    <td>2 years</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><code>_ga_*</code></td>
                                    <td>Google Analytics: Stores session and campaign data</td>
                                    <td>2 years</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><code>_gid</code></td>
                                    <td>Google Analytics: Distinguishes unique users for 24 hours</td>
                                    <td>24 hours</td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                        <p class="cookie-note">
                            <strong>Note:</strong> Google Analytics cookies are set by Google and are subject to Google's Privacy Policy. We use IP anonymization to protect your privacy.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Preference Cookies -->
                    <div class="cookie-info-section cookie-preferences">
                        <div class="cookie-category-header">
                            <h4>
                                <i class="fas fa-cog"></i> Preference Cookies
                            </h4>
                            <span class="cookie-badge consent-badge">Requires Consent</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            These cookies remember your preferences and settings to provide a personalized experience. They are only set if you consent to Preference cookies.
                        </p>
                        <table class="cookie-table">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Cookie Name</th>
                                    <th>Purpose</th>
                                    <th>Expiration</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><code>user_preferences</code></td>
                                    <td>Stores your filter preferences, theme settings, and other user preferences</td>
                                    <td>1 year</td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                    <!-- How to Manage Cookies -->
                    <div class="cookie-manage-section">
                        <h3>
                            <i class="fas fa-tools"></i> How to Manage Cookies
                        </h3>
                        <p>
                            You have several options for managing cookies:
                        </p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Cookie Consent Banner:</strong> When you first visit our website, you'll see a cookie consent banner at the bottom of the page. You can choose to:
                                <ul>
                                    <li>Accept All cookies</li>
                                    <li>Reject All non-essential cookies</li>
                                    <li>Customize your preferences by category</li>
                                </ul>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Change Preferences:</strong> You can change your cookie preferences at any time by clicking the cookie settings link in our footer or by clearing your browser cookies and revisiting our site.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Browser Settings:</strong> Most web browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings. You can:
                                <ul>
                                    <li>Block all cookies</li>
                                    <li>Block third-party cookies</li>
                                    <li>Delete existing cookies</li>
                                    <li>Set your browser to notify you when cookies are set</li>
                                </ul>
                                <p class="cookie-manage-nested-note">
                                    <strong>Note:</strong> Disabling cookies may limit your ability to use certain features of our website. Essential cookies cannot be disabled as they are required for the website to function.
                                </p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <strong>Google Analytics Opt-Out:</strong> To opt out of Google Analytics tracking, you can:
                                <ul>
                                    <li>Use the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a></li>
                                    <li>Reject Analytics cookies in our cookie consent banner</li>
                                </ul>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <p class="cookie-policy-footnote">
                        For more information about how we use cookies or to update your preferences, please <a href="/contact" class="cookie-policy-footnote-link">contact us</a>.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Your Rights -->
                <div class="terms-category">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="fas fa-user-shield"></i> Your Rights
                    </h2>
                    <p>You have the right to:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the personal information we hold about you</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span><strong>Correction:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of your personal information (subject to legal and business requirements)</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span><strong>Opt-Out:</strong> Unsubscribe from marketing communications at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link in our emails</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                            <span><strong>Object:</strong> Object to processing of your personal information for certain purposes</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>
                        To exercise these rights, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a> with your request. We will respond to your request within a reasonable timeframe.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Children's Privacy -->
                <div class="terms-category">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="fas fa-child"></i> Children's Privacy
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        Our website is not intended for children under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has provided us with personal information, please contact us immediately, and we will delete such information.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Changes to This Policy -->
                <div class="terms-category">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="fas fa-sync-alt"></i> Changes to This Privacy Policy
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or for legal, operational, or regulatory reasons. We will notify you of any material changes by posting the updated policy on this page and updating the "Last Updated" date.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        We encourage you to review this Privacy Policy periodically to stay informed about how we protect your information.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Contact Information -->
                <div class="terms-category">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> Contact Us
                    </h2>
                    <p>
                        If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a> through our contact page or reach out via our social media channels.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>Qualitick Collections</strong><br>
                        Email: Available through our <a href="/contact">contact form</a><br>
                        Social Media: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/qualitick_collections" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a> | <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61552156502774" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook</a> | <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@qualitick_collections?_r=1&_t=ZS-93sydbZvxVV" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TikTok</a>
                    </p>
                </div>

    </div>
</div>

